        <h2 class="heading-lg measure">What the AI receptionist does</h2>
        <p>
          An answering service from us does four things on every call that
          reaches it, at any hour. This is the AI receptionist. It is also what
          we mean by an answering service in Bentonville: the call gets finished,
          not just taken down.
        </p>
        <ol>
