          replacing a person who is doing the job. A vendor office or a
          professional firm that staffs a front desk during business hours may
          only need coverage for meetings, campus blocks, and the hours after
          that desk goes home. Replacing that person is not the pitch. A
          supplier office, a satellite team, or a clinic with nobody free to
          pick up is the fit. If you want a human on every call and your volume
          is low, a live answering service can be the right buy. We will say
          which one fits on the assessment, including the option that you do
          not buy anything from us.
        </p>

